  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Uumama 48",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni waan Yusufuuni jed'ani, Abbe fayyaniti, beekhi. Duuba inni ilmaani isaa lachu Manaseefi Efraimu fuud'e abba argu d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yakobooni jed'ani, Gurbaani kanke Yusufuuni ya si argu d'ufe. Jennaani inni haga irreeni isaa fuutufi oljed'e sire ufii gubbaa tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 28.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni waan Yusufuuni jed'e, Waaqi Guddaani lafa Kanaani keesati fulla Luzuti nati mullate na eebise ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan naani jed'e, Anini si daraarse ilmaani tante heddu taati; lafa tanale sifi ilmaani teetii kenna, haga jiru jireennale teesani taati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani tante lamaani, ta lafa Misiri keesati ato anini ind'ufini si d'alate, tiyyuma; Efraimufi Manaseeni akuma ilmaani tiyya Reubenifi Simeoni tiyya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo atini ilmaani d'ibile horatte, sunini tiyya intaatu; d'aalti isiini d'aaltu ta Efraimufi Manase ch'alla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.16+GEN.35.17+GEN.35.18+GEN.35.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 35.16-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti anini waan kana jed'eefi, gaafa anini Mesopotamia d'ufu jiru, Raheliini lafa Kanaani keesati karaati doote, ato Efrathi ingahiinu. Anini guddo iraa laalefad'e d'aatu kara Efrathi awaale. (Efrathi amma maqaani Bethlehemu.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeliini ilmaani Yusufu suni arge waan jed'eeni, Ijoolleeni tunini tami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni waan jed'eeni, Tunini ilmaani tiyya, ta Waaqi lafa Misiri tana keesati naa kenne. Inni waan jed'eeni, Natiini kooti, ineebisaafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeliini jaarumafi ilti isaa waaroofte aka dansaa wo argu dad'abe. Tanaafi Yusufuuni ilmaani isaa itiini d'ufe, inni iti mamarate d'ungate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeliini waan Yusufuuni jed'e, Anini taka waan fuula kanke deebie argu inseene, ammo amma Waaqi la ijoolle teetile na agarsiise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yusufuuni Yakobo ijoolle iraa guure d'aatu isati jilbifate mataani gajed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni Efraimu harka bita ka Israeli d'aabe Manase harka mirga d'aabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Israeliini harka wolmurfate harka isaa mirgicha mata Efraimu ira keeyate, ato inni maand'a tahele, ammalle harka bitaacha mata Manase ka angafa ira keeyate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni Yusufu eebise waan jed'e,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni aka abbaani isaa harka mirgicha mata Efraimu ira keeyate arginaani diqole ingammanne. Duuba harka abba isaa qabe mata Efraimu iraa fuud'e mata Manase ira kaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan abbaani jed'e, Aabbo, akasiniti, angafi kana, harka kanke mirgicha ira keeyad'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo abbaani dide waan jed'e, Imbeekha, gurba, imbeekha. Ijoolleeni Manaseleeni gosa guddo taati. Ammo oboleesi isaa maand'ichi isa ira jabaata, ilmaani isaaleeni gosa heddu taati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 11.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba guyya suni eebiseefi waan jed'e, Gochiti Israeli maqa keesaniini woleebifte waan jettu, Waaqi aka Efraimufi Manase si tolchinna. Akanaani Yakobooni Efraimu angafa Manase tolche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Israeliini waan Yusufuuni jed'e, Ingarta, anini ya duu gahe, ammo Waaqi si woliini tae lafa abbooti teetiti si deebisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini oboleyaani tanteeti inkennu, ammo sii, lafa Shekemu ta biyye dansa qabdu, ta anini gosa Amori sheeftifi guube tiyyaani iraa fud'ad'e, kenna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jecha eegee ka Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
